      "sha": "7fae5f76c8747ec54b3105f58a1a51664f1b1abc",
      "summary_md": "- Decoupled commit data management from UI components, introducing dedicated handlers like `handleAnalyzeForce` and `selectedCommits` for analysis workflows.\n- Added Git utilities including `getCurrentBranch` and `execGit` to enable branch awareness and client-side Git operations.\n- Integrated live analysis enhancements in `liveAnalysis.ts` with new imports for `cockpitOrchestrator` and `driftDetector`.\n- Refactored core analysis and workspace methods (`aggregateFacts`, `workspaceParts`) with signature updates to support new data models.\n- Removed tree view and file status symbols (`getTreeItem`, `stagedFiles`, `getCollapsibleState`), simplifying UI but eliminating related functionality.\n- Introduced client-side database for persistent commit and branch data storage.\n- Updated Cockpit UI components and project overview description for better integration.\n- Minor tweaks to transition methods (`push/pop`, `startTransition`) and element creation (`createElement16`).",
      "symbols_added": 141,
      "symbols_removed": 107,
