      "sha": "4391d5329eb39c3427f0f04837cb8753a703c158",
      "summary_md": "# Commit Summary\n\n- Renamed `createElement15` to `createElement16` with added overloads for enhanced element creation\n- Introduced `execGitStream` for git stream execution and `reconstructIntendedFromEvidence` for state reconstruction from evidence\n- Added `parseSymbolId` utility and `renamedSet` for improved rename detection and handling\n- Integrated difftastic diff analysis via Node.js APIs (`child_process`, `fs`, etc.) for precise semantic diffs\n- Refactored git file querying (`getWorkingDirectoryChanges`, `getStagedFiles`, `getUnstagedFiles`) and selection methods\n- Implemented live analysis tab in cockpit with real-time tracking capabilities\n- Reorganized imports and refactored command registration (`registerCommands`, `getSelectionNodes`, `toggleCommitSelection`)\n- Broad changes across 22 files: 134 symbols added, 20 modified, 173 removed",
