    {
      "sha": "84bb6ad2695e31c3b9886e9886a5a80700fb817e",
      "summary_md": "- Introduced `LiveAnalysis` class with constructor taking `LiveDiffTracker` and `CockpitOrchestrator`, featuring `async analyze()` method and tracking constants (metrics, state, startTime, liveOverrides, intended, evidence, present, absent).\n- Removed cockpit state management including `publishCockpitState`, `cockpitState`, and multiple `cockpitProvider` constants, shifting to live tracking.\n- Integrated `liveAnalysis.ts` with new imports from `vscode`, `liveTracker`, `cockpitOrchestrator`, `workingSnapshot`, and `driftDetector`.\n- Made minor UI adjustments in `MetricsRow.tsx`.\n- Updated signatures for 7 UI/transition functions: `createElement15`, `shouldConstruct`, `startTransition`, `push`, `pop`, `getWorkingSnapshot`, `workspaceParts`.\n- High-scope refactor across 24 files, adding 97 symbols, modifying 7, removing 9; large 1.1 MiB diff indicates broad state management overhaul.\n- Refactored from cockpit-centric state to live analysis orchestration.",
